{"suttaId":"thi-ap6","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[6677,6717],"vripara":"46"},"segments":{"thi-ap6:0.3":"Ekapiṇḍapātadāyikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap6:1.1":"“Nagare bandhumatiyā,","thi-ap6:1.2":"bandhumā nāma khattiyo;","thi-ap6:1.3":"Tassa rañño ahuṃ bhariyā,","thi-ap6:1.4":"ekajjhaṃ cārayāmahaṃ [ekaccaṃ vādayāmahaṃ (syā.)]. 47.","thi-ap6:2.1":"“Rahogatā nisīditvā,","thi-ap6:2.2":"evaṃ cintesahaṃ tadā;","thi-ap6:2.3":"‘Ādāya gamanīyañhi, kusalaṃ natthi me kataṃ. 48.","thi-ap6:3.1":"“‘Mahābhitāpaṃ kaṭukaṃ,","thi-ap6:3.2":"ghorarūpaṃ sudāruṇaṃ;","thi-ap6:3.3":"Nirayaṃ nūna gacchāmi,","thi-ap6:3.4":"ettha me natthi saṃsayo’. 49.","thi-ap6:4.1":"“Rājānaṃ upasaṅkamma,","thi-ap6:4.2":"idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ;","thi-ap6:4.3":"‘Ekaṃ me samaṇaṃ dehi,","thi-ap6:4.4":"bhojayissāmi khattiya’. 50.","thi-ap6:5.1":"“Adāsi me mahārājā,","thi-ap6:5.2":"samaṇaṃ bhāvitindriyaṃ;","thi-ap6:5.3":"Tassa pattaṃ gahetvāna,","thi-ap6:5.4":"paramannena pūrayiṃ [tappayiṃ (sī.)]. 51.","thi-ap6:6.1":"“Pūrayitvā paramannaṃ,","thi-ap6:6.2":"gandhālepaṃ akāsahaṃ;","thi-ap6:6.3":"Jālena pidahitvāna,","thi-ap6:6.4":"vatthayugena [pītacoḷena (syā.), mahānelena (pī.)] chādayiṃ. 52.","thi-ap6:7.1":"“Ārammaṇaṃ mamaṃ etaṃ,","thi-ap6:7.2":"sarāmi yāvajīvihaṃ;","thi-ap6:7.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā,","thi-ap6:7.4":"tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ. 53.","thi-ap6:8.1":"“Tiṃsānaṃ devarājūnaṃ,","thi-ap6:8.2":"mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap6:8.3":"Manasā patthitaṃ mayhaṃ,","thi-ap6:8.4":"nibbattati yathicchitaṃ [yaticchakaṃ (syā.), yadicchakaṃ (pī. ka.)]. 54.","thi-ap6:9.1":"“Vīsānaṃ cakkavattīnaṃ,","thi-ap6:9.2":"mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap6:9.3":"Ocitattāva [upacitattā (syā.)] hutvāna,","thi-ap6:9.4":"saṃsarāmi bhavesvahaṃ. 55.","thi-ap6:10.1":"“Sabbabandhanamuttāhaṃ,","thi-ap6:10.2":"apetā me upādikā;","thi-ap6:10.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā,","thi-ap6:10.4":"natthi dāni punabbhavo. 56.","thi-ap6:11.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe,","thi-ap6:11.2":"yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","thi-ap6:11.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","thi-ap6:11.4":"piṇḍapātassidaṃ phalaṃ. 57.","thi-ap6:12.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe…","thi-ap6:12.3":"viharāmi anāsavā. 58.","thi-ap6:13.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi…pe…","thi-ap6:13.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ. 59.","thi-ap6:14.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso…pe…","thi-ap6:14.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap6:15.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ ekapiṇḍapātadāyikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap6:16.1":"Ekapiṇḍapātadāyikātheriyāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ. 7."},"unsure":["thi-ap6:2.3"],"preface":[],"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
